# 40. IMPORTANT INTEGRATION LIMITATIONS

Handle these honestly.

## WhatsApp

Ordinary WhatsApp sharing may require user interaction to select a conversation and confirm sending.

Implement the best supported native sharing experience.

Do not promise automatic sending unless an authorized official integration supports it.

## Email

Email apps may impose attachment size limits.

Handle large files with an appropriate secure alternative, while respecting the customer's privacy and sharing choices.

## Payments

Real payments require:

- Provider account
- Merchant approval
- Credentials
- Backend integration
- Webhook verification
- Testing

Do not simulate payments in production.

## Maps

Maps require configuration and API credentials where applicable.

## AI

AI features require API configuration and must use secure backend calls.

## Scanning

Scanner performance depends on camera hardware and platform support.

## Cloud backup

Cloud storage may incur costs.

Implement configurable storage plans and quotas.

